<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">Knowledge development on this topic is still </span><span style="margin: 0px;">emerging</span><span style="margin: 0px;">, but the following provides a helpful starting point with insights into competencies and an overview of </span><span style="margin: 0px;">different types</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> of practices.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Competencies You Need</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Although there is limited empirical research on what these teaching roles specifically require, recent studies (e.g., Veltman et al., 2022; Oonk et al., 2020; Flavian, 2024) highlight the following competencies:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Flexibility and adaptability</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">N</span><span style="margin: 0px">avigat</span><span style="margin: 0px">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> unpredictable learning processes, shift roles as needed, and tailor your approach to diverse learning needs.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Interdisciplinary understanding and content breadth</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">They </span><span style="margin: 0px">don’t</span><span style="margin: 0px"> need to be an expert in all fields, but you can make connections between disciplines and help students do the same.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Mediation and communication skills</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">M</span><span style="margin: 0px">aintain</span><span style="margin: 0px">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> relationships with external partners and </span><span style="margin: 0px">create</span><span style="margin: 0px"> a safe space for dialogue between different perspectives.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Coaching students</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">S</span><span style="margin: 0px">upport</span><span style="margin: 0px">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> students in developing transdisciplinary competencies such as critical thinking, collaboration, and self-reflection.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Curiosity and professional development</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">C</span><span style="margin: 0px">ontinuously develop</span><span style="margin: 0px">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">one</span><span style="margin: 0px">self and remain open to new forms of education and feedback from practice.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Dealing with tensions</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">H</span><span style="margin: 0px">elp</span><span style="margin: 0px">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> students (and </span><span style="margin: 0px">them</span><span style="margin: 0px">sel</span><span style="margin: 0px">ves</span><span style="margin: 0px">) cop</span><span style="margin: 0px">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> with uncertainty, ambiguity, and tensions that arise when learning together about complex problems.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">These competencies take time to develop and highlight the importance of professional space and support within the team and organization.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;Not every teacher </span><span style="margin: 0px">immediately</span><span style="margin: 0px"> feels comfortable in this role — </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important to be open about this and to learn together.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Different Practices: Who Provides the Content Expertise?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">When designing transdisciplinary education, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important to consider </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">who brings in the disciplinary perspectives</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> — the students or the teachers.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;This directly affects </span><span style="margin: 0px">the </span><span style="margin: 0px">role </span><span style="margin: 0px">as</span><span style="margin: 0px"> a teacher.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="1" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Student-intensive education</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;In broad interdisciplinarity, students bring their own disciplinary knowledge.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">The</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">teacher </span><span style="margin: 0px">guide</span><span style="margin: 0px">s </span><span style="margin: 0px">the learning process as a </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">guide on the side</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px">do</span><span style="margin: 0px">es</span><span style="margin: 0px">n’t</span><span style="margin: 0px"> need to have all the content </span><span style="margin: 0px">expertise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">them</span><span style="margin: 0px">sel</span><span style="margin: 0px">ves</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> This requires a safe learning environment where students actively share their knowledge and learn from each other.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="2" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Teacher-intensive education</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">In narrow interdisciplinarity, teachers provide </span><span style="margin: 0px">the various</span><span style="margin: 0px"> perspectives.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> They</span><span style="margin: 0px"> take on a more traditional role (</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">sage on the stage</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">) and offer content frameworks or knowledge transfer.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Students are </span><span style="margin: 0px">relatively more</span><span style="margin: 0px"> passive in this setup.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Both forms can work, but they </span><span style="margin: 0px">require</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">different design</span><span style="margin: 0px"> choices and teaching skills.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Often, a student-intensive approach is preferred because it aligns better with contemporary, active learning and is less vulnerable to teacher absence.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Teaching Formats and Organization: Team Teaching or Not?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">To ensure all relevant perspectives are included in the education, </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">co-teaching with a multidisciplinary team of educators</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> is a logical choice.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">However, this is costly, vulnerable, and organizationally complex.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Therefore, a common approach is to have </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">one main facilitator (coach)</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">, with </span><span style="margin: 0px">additional</span><span style="margin: 0px"> content contributions from others via guest lectures, online resources, or external experts.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Tip:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Design the education collaboratively as a </span><span style="margin: 0px">team, but</span><span style="margin: 0px"> implement it with a compact core group of teachers</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Ensure that students, through their own backgrounds and online resources, have access to diverse perspectives.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This way, you can do justice to the complexity without running into organizational challenges.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">References</span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Flavian, H. (2024). Transdisciplinary Teaching: Main Concepts and Perspectives. In Transdisciplinary Teaching in Inclusive Schools: Promoting Transdisciplinary Education for Learners with Special Needs (</span><span style="margin: 0px">pp</span><span style="margin: 0px">. 1-15). Cham: Springer International Publishing.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Oonk, C., Gulikers, J. T., den Brok, P. J., Wesselink, R., Beers, P. J., &amp; Mulder, M. (2020). Teachers as brokers: adding a university-society perspective to higher education teacher competence profiles. Higher Education, 80(4), 701-718/</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span></font></p><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Veltman, M., Van Keulen, J., &amp; Voogt, J. (2022): Teacher strategies that foster students’ </span><span style="margin: 0px">boundarycrossing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">expertise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> when addressing problems with wicked tendencies, Journal of Vocational Education &amp; Training.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div></body>
